N + N --> N2 + CN
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + CO --> N + N + CO
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + CO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + CO2 --> N + N + CO2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + CO2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + N2 --> N + N + N2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + N2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + NO --> N + N + NO
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + NO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + O2 --> N + N + O2
